## Infrastructure Directory Structure

```text
deployment/
├── terraform/                 # Declarative IaC definitions
│   ├── vars/
│   │   └── env.tfvars         # Environment-specific variable values
│   ├── apis.tf                # Required cloud API enablement
│   ├── iam.tf                 # Service account and IAM bindings
│   ├── providers.tf           # Provider and backend state configuration
│   ├── service.tf             # Primary compute/service definitions
│   └── variables.tf           # Input variable declarations
└── README.md                  # This file
```

